WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.000
A report describes one moment.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.400
A watch keeps checking the pages behind it.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.800
Two clicks to set up, with the price page already ticked.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.300
When one changes, an email says what changed.

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.100
One change, one email, named in the subject line.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.300
Prices are watched by default. Everything else is off.

7
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.800
The email shows both versions.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.000
The old text, the new text, and the date each was read.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.900
What it costs is next.
